## Post to Thread

Appends a post to the thread about a card, and opens that thread first when the card has none. It is the one writer of posts, so a thread's order and its `lastActivityAt` always agree.

```ts
await new PostToThreadCommand(commandContext).execute({
  about: supportCase,
  author: agent,
  body: 'Rolled back at 14:00; the errors stopped.',
});
```

### It refuses

- an empty body, since an empty post adds a timestamp and nothing else;
- a post with no author, since an anonymous post cannot be answered;
- a closed thread, since closing is how a conversation is ended on purpose.

The linked example is the thread the command writes to: the checkout 502s case conversation.

### Non-goals

No notifications and no mentions; Notify Participant owns telling people.
